This product also includes processed geospatial data derived from the National
Land Numerical Information Download Service published by the Ministry of Land,
Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism of Japan (MLIT):

- School data, fiscal year 2021:
  https://nlftp.mlit.go.jp/ksj/gml/datalist/KsjTmplt-P29-v2_0.html
- Railway data, fiscal year 2025 (CC BY 4.0):
  https://nlftp.mlit.go.jp/ksj/gml/datalist/KsjTmplt-N02-2025.html

WakaRoute joins school locations by MEXT school code and calculates straight-
line distances to railway-station group representative points. These processed
distances are not walking distances, routes, or travel times. The source data
may contain spatial error and time lag; WakaRoute does not imply endorsement by
MLIT. Reusers must preserve this attribution, the processing notice, and the
applicable source-data terms.

